            </div>

            <div class="font-sample" style="font-family: 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 1rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #f5f5f5; border-left: 4px solid #666;">
              Veterans serving veterans. <span style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: #666;">(Arial Narrow - Bold)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="font-sample" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 1rem 0; padding: 1rem; background: #f5f5f5; border-left: 4px solid #666;">
